<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Avmin signs deal for Zambian Konkola North.</title>
<headline>Avmin signs deal for Zambian Konkola North.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African mining house Avmin Ltd said on Friday it had finalised an agreement with the Zambian government and Zambia Consolidated Copper Mines (ZCCM) for it to acquire the Konkola North copper mining concession.</p>
</text>
